#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:61
msgid "GPS Failsafe and Glitch Protection"
msgstr "GPS 失控保护与信号抖动保护"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:5 f717fbc454304a1190822de0cdb619dc
msgid "EKF Failsafe"
msgstr "EKF 失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:7 a730cbfcab3f44fe853127e7439d6281
msgid ""
"The EKF failsafe monitors the health of EKF (the position and attitude "
"estimation system) to catch problems with the vehicle's position estimate "
"(often caused by GPS glitches or compass errors) and prevent \"flyaways\"."
msgstr ""
"EKF 失控保护监控 EKF（位置和姿态估计系统）的健康状态，以捕捉飞行器位置估计的问题（通常由 GPS "
"信号抖动或罗盘误差引起），并防止\"飞走\"事故。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:10 028db8f26da94c4d8224d808bc45568d
msgid "When will it trigger?"
msgstr "何时会触发？"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:12 d7351edb5e6c4474a0b6c040fc4b28ec
msgid ""
"The EKF failsafe will trigger when any two of the EKF \"variances\" for "
"compass, position or velocity are higher than the :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH "
"<FS_EKF_THRESH>` parameter value for 1 second."
msgstr ""
"当罗盘、位置或速度的任意两个 EKF\"方差\"超过 :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` 参数值持续 1 "
"秒时，EKF 失控保护将触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:14 0e1089fbd4e548519b8522df41d0e5b9
msgid ""
"These \"variances\" come from the EKF itself and are numbers indicating the "
"EKF's confidence in its estimates.  The values are between 0 and 1 with 0 "
"meaning the estimate is very trustworthy and 1.0 is very untrustworthy."
msgstr "这些\"方差\"来自 EKF 本身，是表示 EKF 对其估计置信度的数值。数值在 0 到 1 之间，0 表示估计非常可信，1.0 表示非常不可信。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:16 69bf360493b247a6864e031f81eb8da1
msgid ""
"The EKF calculates these \"variances\" by comparing the results from "
"multiple sensors.  So for example, if the GPS position suddenly jumps but "
"the accelerometers do not show a sudden acceleration, the EKF variance for "
"position would climb (i.e become less trustworthy)"
msgstr ""
"EKF 通过比较多个传感器的结果来计算这些\"方差\"。例如，如果 GPS 位置突然跳变，而加速度计未显示突然加速，则位置的 EKF "
"方差将升高（即变得不那么可信）"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:18 43f471ed7c3444698748100bb6ad02dc
msgid ""
"The variances can be viewed in real-time on the ground station.  If using "
"Mission Planner click on the \"EKF\" label on the HUD."
msgstr "方差可以在地面站上实时查看。使用 Mission Planner 时，点击 HUD 上的\"EKF\"标签。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:25 6ae8a88029e947b0847ad3b3735eaac9
msgid "What will happen when the failsafe triggers?"
msgstr "失控保护触发后会发生什么？"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:27 6829c623b0df42c48f3e67767525d09e
msgid ""
"The autopilot's `LED will flash red-yellow or blue-yellow and the tone-alarm"
" will sound "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j-CMLrAwlco&feature=player_detailpage&t=60s>`__"
msgstr ""
"飞控的 `LED 将闪烁红黄色或蓝黄色，并发出音调报警 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j-CMLrAwlco&feature=player_detailpage&t=60s>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:28 f74c298acbf546628056298e93834d61
msgid ""
"\"EKF variance\" will appear on the ground station's HUD if telemetry is "
"connected"
msgstr "如果数传已连接，地面站 HUD 上将显示「EKF variance」（EKF 方差）"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:29 dc18e60517dc4d21bb043ecbda7fca0f
msgid ""
"In manual flight modes that do not require GPS (i.e. Stabilize, Acro, "
"AltHold) nothing further will happen but the pilot will be unable to switch "
"into autonomous flight modes (Loiter, PosHold, RTL, Guided, Auto) until the "
"failure clears"
msgstr ""
"在不需要 GPS 的手动飞行模式下（即 "
"Stabilize、Acro、AltHold），不会有进一步操作，但飞手在故障排除之前将无法切换至自主飞行模式（Loiter、PosHold、RTL、Guided、Auto）"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:30 ae35cd490ea143019b41d9a00b797b33
msgid ""
"In autonomous modes that require GPS (i.e. Loiter, PosHold, RTL, Guided, "
"Auto, etc) the :ref:`FS_EKF_ACTION <FS_EKF_ACTION>` controls the behaviour."
"  By default this is \"1\" meaning the vehicle will switch to :ref:`Land "
"<land-mode>` mode.  This is a \"pilot controlled\" land meaning the pilot "
"will have control of the roll and pitch angle but the vehicle will descend "
"at the :ref:`LAND_SPEED <LAND_SPEED>`.  It will land and finally disarm its "
"motors. Other options are to hover (ALTHOLD) or LAND even if in STABILIZE "
"mode if the EKF failsafe occurs."
msgstr ""
"在需要 GPS 的自主模式下（即 Loiter、PosHold、RTL、Guided、Auto 等），:ref:`FS_EKF_ACTION "
"<FS_EKF_ACTION>` 参数控制行为。默认值为\"1\"，表示飞行器将切换至 :ref:`Land <land-mode>` "
"模式。这是\"飞手控制\"的降落，即飞手可以控制横滚和俯仰角，但飞行器将以 :ref:`LAND_SPEED <LAND_SPEED>` "
"下降。它将降落并最终上锁电机。其他选项包括悬停（ALTHOLD）或即使在 STABILIZE 模式下也执行 LAND（如果发生 EKF 失控保护）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:31 4896df95e7fa450cb54bd1071a4a6db5
msgid "An EKF failsafe error will be written to the dataflash logs"
msgstr "EKF 失控保护错误将写入 dataflash 日志"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:33 ab607ecf665c4b5186e45587190b609c
msgid ""
"After an EKF failsafe occurs, the pilot can re-take control (using the "
"flight mode switch) in a manual flight mode such as :ref:`AltHold "
"<altholdmode>` to bring the vehicle home."
msgstr ""
"EKF 失控保护发生后，飞手可以通过飞行模式开关切换到手动飞行模式（如 :ref:`AltHold "
"<altholdmode>`）重新接管控制，将飞行器飞回。"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:36 5ac1187ae3a547559e48c93dea7b7f57
msgid "Adjusting the Sensitivity of the failsafe"
msgstr "调整失控保护的灵敏度"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:38 9da2e1f9b6434a63a964a9448124d7e0
msgid ""
"The :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` parameter can be adjusted to "
"control the sensitivity of the failsafe"
msgstr "可调整 :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` 参数来控制失控保护的灵敏度"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:40 808e4a0ea09a476499e531d02b5f2854
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` = 0 to disable the EKF failsafe"
msgstr "将 :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` 设为 0 以禁用 EKF 失控保护"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:41 1ad0c4627d98472eac9f112cbb818e85
msgid ""
"Increase :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` to values between 0.8 and 1.0 "
"to reduce the chance of an EKF failsafe.  The downside of increasing this "
"parameter value is that during a flyaway caused by a bad compass or GPS "
"glitch, the vehicle will fly further away before the vehicle is "
"automatically switched to LAND mode"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` 增大至 0.8 到 1.0 之间，以降低 EKF "
"失控保护触发的可能性。增大此参数的缺点是，在因罗盘故障或 GPS 信号抖动引起的飞走事故中，飞行器将飞得更远才会自动切换至 LAND 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:42 1825b15da79f4d3c9fc347934bae9ff2
msgid ""
"Decrease :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` to values as low as 0.6 to "
"increase the chance of an EKF failsafe triggering quickly.  The downside of "
"lowering this value is the EKF failsafe could trigger a LAND during "
"aggressive maneuvers"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH <FS_EKF_THRESH>` 降低至 0.6，以增加 EKF 失控保护快速触发的可能性。降低此值的缺点是"
" EKF 失控保护可能在激烈机动时触发 LAND"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:45 3a275e407224469fa4433270299aa317
msgid "Dataflash Log example"
msgstr "Dataflash 日志示例"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:47 929f859be7ef489b9b261188b3cebfa5
msgid ""
"The EKF's innovations can be viewed by graphing a dataflash log's NKF4.SP "
"(position innovation), NKF4.SV (velocity innovation) and NKF4.SM (compass "
"innovation) values"
msgstr ""
"可通过绘制 dataflash 日志的 NKF4.SP（位置创新）、NKF4.SV（速度创新）和 NKF4.SM（罗盘创新）值来查看 EKF 的创新量"

#: ../../source/docs/ekf-inav-failsafe.rst:49 64fd03dee0c348b9bce0df3fb3c1f148
msgid ""
"The graph below show the EKF's innovations for position (green), velocity "
"(red) and compass (yellow) during an actual EKF failsafe event.  During this"
" incident external interference (probably from a high-powered radio tower "
"nearby) caused the GPS to report inaccurate positions and velocities.  The "
"vehicle switches to Land mode soon after both velocity and position "
"innovations climb over the :ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH<FS_EKF_THRESH>` value of 0.8"
msgstr ""
"下图显示了实际 EKF 失控保护事件期间位置（绿色）、速度（红色）和罗盘（黄色）的 EKF "
"创新量。此次事件中，外部干扰（可能来自附近的大功率无线电塔）导致 GPS 报告不准确的位置和速度。当速度和位置创新量均超过 "
":ref:`FS_EKF_THRESH<FS_EKF_THRESH>` 值 0.8 后，飞行器很快切换至 Land 模式"

